          <span class="text-2xl drop-shadow-md">👑</span>
          <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-amber-500/30 text-jungle-gold font-black flex items-center justify-center text-lg border-2 border-jungle-gold shadow-inner">1</div>
          <span class="font-black text-sm text-white truncate mt-1" id="lb-rank1-name">---</span>
